      "content": "but i don't want to rest or find a way around. the fog is too thick to see anything else. it feels less like a pause and more like a conclusion. like the story was written to end exactly at this cliffside. doesn't it feel more natural for a path to just... cease? to reach its final, quiet point?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
